          <a href="https://www.ncs.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NCS portal</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Barry Schwartz's research on choice overload and decision paralysis, explaining why more options can reduce rather than improve decision quality.
          <a href="https://thedecisionlab.com/reference-guide/economics/the-paradox-of-choice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Decision Lab: Paradox of Choice</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          The State of Working India 2026 report on graduate employment and unemployment patterns.
          <a href="https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/two-thirds-of-unemployed-youth-are-graduates-state-of-working-india-report-126031701278_1.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Business Standard coverage of State of Working India 2026</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          World Economic Forum Future of Jobs Report 2025 on rising demand for analytical thinking, creative thinking, and AI/big-data skills.
          <a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WEF Future of Jobs Report 2025</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          OECD research on the shift toward skills-first hiring and reduced reliance on formal degree requirements.
          <a href="https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/a-skills-first-labour-market_2e1b85f0-en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OECD: A Skills-First Labour Market</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Research on gap years in India: mental-health benefits, risk of unplanned drift, and outcomes for students who use the year with a clear plan.
          <a href="https://www.mindler.com/blog/why-take-a-gap-year-exploring-the-benefits-and-challenges/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mindler on gap years</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Data on drop-year outcomes for competitive entrance exams and the real odds of a repeat attempt without a changed strategy.
          <a href="https://deekshalearning.com/blog/neet-dropper-success-rate-statistics-reality-check-how-to-beat-the-odds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NEET dropper success-rate data</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Research on psychometric test validity limits, including cultural bias, age sensitivity, and situational factors that affect results.
          <a href="https://fundaspring.com/blogs/knowledge-hub/psychometric-testing-in-career-counseling-pros-cons-and-best-practices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Psychometric testing pros, cons, and best practices</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          National Apprenticeship Training Scheme and Skill India apprenticeship routes as a paid, hands-on alternative or supplement to a straight degree path.
          <a href="https://www.apprenticeshipindia.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apprenticeship India</a>,
          <a href="https://nats.education.gov.in/about-us.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NATS</a>
